  "lyrics":[
    {
      "section_id":"section_0",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Darling, I been waitin' in the cold",
          "rhyme":"old",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Holdin' this umbrella for you",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"The raindrops make me feel romantic",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Let's run away, sail through the Atlantic",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Two of us, such a wonderful pair",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Stuck inside this love affair",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Try to make you smile, that view is worth the while",
          "rhyme":"il",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"The only one I call, all I do is hit redial",
          "rhyme":"al",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Why don't you come and lay with me?",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Let's make a couple babies",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"I know we still so young",
          "rhyme":"uN",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"The idea seems crazy",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCCDDEFGHIH",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABCCDDCEFCBC"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"chorus",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Your love makes every day of mine worth it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Sometimes I wonder if I even deserve it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Look in my eyes, you know how I feel",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"I know it's real, girl, let's close the deal",
          "rhyme":"il",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AABC",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AABA"
    },
