          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"I know you like when I hold you tight",
          "rhyme":"ajt",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"What's your favorite color? Let me know and I'll paint the sky",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Larry_Lovestein"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"And all I wanna do",
          "rhyme":"o",
